From e712dbfbc6c287d5b8cc42733b801d02aa2dee8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FP mod <fpmod@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:03:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/29] Battle digivolution: DP row under the HUD box, the
 effect actually plays

The energy bar is now a DP row in the HUD's own style: the party boxes are
raised 10 lines and each gets a row under its name strip with a "DP" label
and a gauge like HP / MP (green filling, gold and white when Digivolve is
ready, blue for the Champion form's turns left). The digivolution effect
(task 7) was created in a slot no task updates, so it never showed and the
change looked instant; it now runs as a child of the fighter (slot 1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1oHeiADE8njqFxkaQnJAX
---
 include/stag3000/evo_native.h |   4 +-
 src/stag3000/evo_native.inc   | 142 +++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 src/stag3000/fighterhud.c     |  26 ++++++-
 3 files changed, 133 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

